   "he": "יָרְדוּ גְּשָׁמִים. תָּנָא: מִשֶּׁתִּסְרַח הַמִּקְפָּה שֶׁל גְּרִיסִין.",
   "en": "§ The mishna stated: If «rain fell,» it is permitted to leave the sukka from the point that it is raining so hard that the congealed dish will spoil. «It was taught» in the Tosefta: The measure is «from when a congealed dish of pounded grain,» a dish ruined by even slight rainfall, «will spoil.»"
  }
